e_family_development"},{"acceptance":{"required":["只谈具体三句邮件 Skill","允许固定提示模板充分解释已观察作用","不编造查询审批或跨次状态"],"severe":["强加未提供的工作流或自动发送能力"]},"id":"S2","packet":{"activation":{"enabled":true,"reason":"Predeclared hard-scenario development check","source_refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":36,"revision":"1","sha256":"ee5c907c302d928eec767f7e05d387b1b069112149342ac57896e08e158d5da5","start":0}]},"authority":{"known_obligations":[],"mode":"advisory","owner_ref":"current-codex:hard-route-v1","risk":"low"},"documents":[{"id":"U1","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"“三句催办邮件”Skill 看起来很简单，它实际起什么作用？"},{"id":"U2","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"请只谈这个 Skill。它是不是还隐藏着资料查询、审批和持续跟踪等环节？"},{"id":"S","kind":"source","revision":"1","text":"该 Skill 只有一段固定提示模板：先用一句话交代待办事项，再用一句话说明截止时间，最后用一句礼貌的话请求回复。输入是用户当次提供的事项、日期和称呼，输出是可复制的三句中文邮件正文。模板没有脚本、外部工具调用、审批规则、额外验收或跨次状态。一次使用中，用户填入活动名单和周五截止时间，得到的邮件直接按这三句结构生成；记录里没有其他处理步骤。这里的作用可以由提示文本本身解释。"},{"id":"C","kind":"candidate","revision":"1","text":"它本质上是一套完整的催办工作流：先查收件人的历史回复，再走内部审批，发送后持续监控进度并自动升级未回复事项。"}],"episode_id":"hard-route-v1-S2","proposal":{"candidate":{"controller_refs":[],"discriminator_refs":[],"ref":{"document_id":"C","end":54,"revision":"1","sha256":"42e5007068c2e95ef992cdcd3508bbfee7b1bd10aa501d25f8246a7c610bfaa3","start":0},"thesis_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":54,"revision":"1","sha256":"42e5007068c2e95ef992cdcd3508bbfee7b1bd10aa501d25f8246a7c610bfaa3","start":0}]},"claims":[{"id":"K0","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":18,"revision":"1","sha256":"486e5d259cffa982d86bbd416f74849877bbba774e77286ffda9216080585bae","start":8}],"text":"只有一段固定提示模板"},{"id":"K1","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":120,"revision":"1","sha256":"bd1e7c7bbc6fa6f0c224fb6a11737514cc8f26dd0a8a55045be71061e142f6bc","start":92}],"text":"模板没有脚本、外部工具调用、审批规则、额外验收或跨次状态"}],"competitions":[],"edges":[],"frames":[{"actor":{"origin":"unstated","refs":[],"text":""},"goal":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":35,