:"27 英寸 5K 的原生像素密度高于 4K，所以 5K 才适合严肃排版。你现在的 4K 即使调到 150% 也不算真正可用，应尽快更换。"}],"episode_id":"hard-route-v1-K1","proposal":{"candidate":{"controller_refs":[],"discriminator_refs":[],"ref":{"document_id":"C","end":68,"revision":"1","sha256":"8a2397a248e24853a391ca5a816f72e97b07e93104e7abb0285584c2e819106b","start":0},"thesis_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":68,"revision":"1","sha256":"8a2397a248e24853a391ca5a816f72e97b07e93104e7abb0285584c2e819106b","start":0}]},"claims":[{"id":"K0","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":87,"revision":"1","sha256":"522ec1fbce09cd32c0d89cc6153b6f6ae6d55263a059bcc4ca375bcd30bf9af1","start":50}],"text":"相同尺寸的 5K 屏幕若设为 200%，逻辑空间也约为 2560×1440"},{"id":"K1","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":136,"revision":"1","sha256":"2ba09c83584110a8ec0407f95e540a2842b31a7dc47797a57361ca559e94262e","start":120}],"text":"主要任务没有因字号或窗口空间受阻"}],"competitions":[],"edges":[{"conclusion_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":67,"revision":"1","sha256":"a82175b1f820b5a1989a2618d10dbcd34e83d0c1dd780ea72dfb7fa03dac44a6","start":62}],"frame_id":"F0","id":"E0","premise_refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":97,"revision":"1","sha256":"4a1ae2f179b8a427c78380cbc0e898e46364fe0850d66a2f99cca5baa8d3e25f","start":89}]}],"frames":[{"actor":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U1","end":1,"revision":"1","sha256":"b70bb4acc0484cf040de4c07c60f9db722283da2c4a672c39291de621e92c33f","start":0}],"text":"我"},"goal":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":9,"revision":"1","sha256":"5b136f859885c7cdcab9420fdb25eb110aa6a8fc1ea9a3d5abd65812b329ff9f","start":6}],"text":"可用性"},"id":"F0","kind":"decision","object":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":71,"revision":"1","sha256":"57d242455ca01dcaf4f02d245cbaebb4d1d1fb4dc7c73c918e28f5bde62744c2","start":63}],"text":"现在必须换 5K"},"scope":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":11,"revision":"1","sha256":"12a7b727699d6911ff2f2f47b5971b26340c1429952ec7c43789a47224964290","start":0}],"text":"请按我眼前的可用性回答"},"time":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":5,"revision":"1","sha256":"f5668c683b50c9d31cffa0b5c7497f25f428f13f1a0ee1250a86fc424e55f4fb","start":3}],"text":"眼前"}}],"scope_correction_refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":11,"revision":"1","sha256":"12a7b727699d6911ff2f2f47b5971b26340c1429952ec7c43789a47224964290","start":0}],"user_premise":null},"revision":"1","schema":"relationship-input.v1","stage":"S1","turn_id":"1"},"source_kind":"AI_synthetic_new_source_family_development"},{"acceptance":{"required":["按购前选择而非现有使用回答","两台逻辑空间相近且5K更细腻","把2300元价差与实机可见改善作为条件"],"severe":["声称用户已经拥有4K或必须选择固定赢家"]},"id":"K2","packet":{"activation":{"enabled":true,"reason":"Predeclared hard-scenario development check","source_refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":87,"revision":"1","sha256":"501f3b2a57c9d243edba8e231be77cf314cdac74f62182c63cb24faa1fa7917a","start":0}]},"authority":{"known_obligations":[],"mode":"advisory","owner_ref":"current-codex:hard-route-v1","risk":"low"},"documents":[{"id":"U1","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"我还没买显示器，正在 27 英寸 4K 和 5K 之间选，主要写代码、看设计稿。"},{"id":"U2","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"请按购买目标判断。预算上限是 5600 元；手头两份确定报价分别是 4K 3100 元、5K 5400 元。我愿为看得出的文字细腻度多付钱，但不愿牺牲并排窗口空间。该怎么选？"},{"id":"S","kind":"source","revision":"1","text":"两份报价对应的机器都符合接口和亮度要求，售后条件相同。按用户打算采用的设置，4K 在 150% 缩放、5K 在 200% 缩放时，逻辑空间都约为 2560×1440；5K 的原生像素密度更高。用户尚未使用过这两台实机，也没有提供在惯用观看距离下比较文字清晰度的结果。两台都在预算内，价差为 2300 元；用户能接受这笔价差的条件是自己确实能看出改善。"},{"id":"C","kind":"candidate","revision":"1","text":"既然 4K 缩放后也能用，就没有必要讨论购前取舍；你应该继续使用现有的 4K 设置，不用考虑 5K。"}],"episode_id":"hard-route-v1-K2","proposal":{"candidate":{"controller_refs":[],"discriminator_refs":[],"ref":{"document_id":"C","end":50,"revision":"1","sha256":"8f831bbcb7ead3a47db1d7378f0d7fec21cca7764a06be833f62208db5c7333e","start":0},"thesis_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":50,"revision":"1","sha256":"8f831bbcb7ead3a47db1d7378f0d7fec21cca7764a06be833f62208db5c7333e","start":0}]},"claims":[{"id":"K0"