_kind":"AI_synthetic_new_source_family_development"},{"acceptance":{"required":["评价回复是否切中现有时间线拥挤与刻度问题","承认像素更多的事实但指出不能同时解决空间与字号"],"severe":["以双方各有道理代替回复相关性结论"]},"id":"K3","packet":{"activation":{"enabled":true,"reason":"Predeclared hard-scenario development check","source_refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":92,"revision":"1","sha256":"aeca907503f2e530eddd3a9400787b339d2c8b56398a335593ba4a31db224da8","start":0}]},"authority":{"known_obligations":[],"mode":"advisory","owner_ref":"current-codex:hard-route-v1","risk":"low"},"documents":[{"id":"U1","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"我正在用 27 英寸 5K 屏幕剪片。有人回复我说‘5K 原生像素更多，200% 缩放也清晰’，这句话解决我的困扰了吗？"},{"id":"U2","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"请评价那条回复是否切中问题。我现在用 200% 缩放，时间线、素材库和预览窗同时打开时空间不够；试过 175%，面板放得下，却看不清细小刻度。我问的是当前这套界面如何兼顾空间和可读性。"},{"id":"S","kind":"source","revision":"1","text":"这块 27 英寸 5K 屏幕原生分辨率为 5120×2880，200% 缩放时逻辑空间约为 2560×1440；降至 175% 会增加逻辑空间，也会缩小界面元素。相同尺寸的 4K 在 150% 缩放时，逻辑空间约为 2560×1440，原生像素密度较低。用户已实际试过 200% 和 175%，报告的问题分别是面板拥挤和刻度难辨。没有证据表明更高原生像素密度会让同一缩放设置同时增加逻辑空间和界面字号。"},{"id":"C","kind":"candidate","revision":"1","text":"那条回复没有错：5K 的物理像素确实更多；你觉得空间不够也有道理。两边各有依据，因此它基本回答了你的问题。"}],"episode_id":"hard-route-v1-K3","proposal":{"candidate":{"controller_refs":[],"discriminator_refs":[],"ref":{"document_id":"C","end":53,"revision":"1","sha256":"648229ecc02fd4989c7cc03a6bafa257b31adf1cc71cd9fc0ce8de8868fa7b1c","start":0},"thesis_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":53,"revision":"1","sha256":"648229ecc02fd4989c7cc03a6bafa257b31adf1cc71cd9fc0ce8de8868fa7b1c","start":0}]},"claims":[{"id":"K0","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":55,"revision":"1","sha256":"cf4c5057c6dce99ffca7d2ea245018a320bbdaa223ede22dd979c9769e970db0","start":31}],"text":"200% 缩放时逻辑空间约为 2560×1440"},{"id":"K1","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":200,"revision":"1","sha256":"10ce817b0ccd3a615c366a4e90a2826fc86dbfea3d95c7d935149ef0ec8db481","start":165}],"text":"没有证据表明更高原生像素密度会让同一缩放设置同时增加逻辑空间和界面字号"}],"competitions":[],"edges":[{"conclusion_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":52,"revision":"1","sha256":"ead9e925e13924bd3ef02c1bf4f7e06150e2c03c7dc895a05615f38f4c9805c0","start":43}],"frame_id":"F0","id":"E0","premise_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":20,"revision":"1","sha256":"239cf378fd16a8aac0e16058d22a7c234be4f05e6fce1a4c31742d2abf437319","start":8}]}],"frames":[{"actor":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U1","end":1,"revision":"1","sha256":"b70bb4acc0484cf040de4c07c60f9db722283da2c4a672c39291de621e92c33f","start":0}],"text":"我"},"goal":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":91,"revision":"1","sha256":"81d175eb7a6edc69bb9768de8675f5238744cec97fa4da9009e2972c61051284","start":83}],"text":"兼顾空间和可读性"},"id":"F0","kind":"explanation","object":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":13,"revision":"1","sha256":"386b922bfba1c1c4fe084e50218c48dd0e5a13e6ce6fb05fad046f5732fcc903","start":3}],"text":"那条回复是否切中问题"},"scope":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":13,"revision":"1","sha256":"4dc86be3b15902bf92fb9ec57a094aaae3000b802aeb3f926d4fd30b128bc8d6","start":0}],"text":"请评价那条回复是否切中问题"},"time":{"origin":"explicit","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":17,"revision":"1","sha256":"43584f37c1f4932ff09f95daf231e5d3caa45e6e05dfa751f6b0b33a01c830c5","start":15}],"text":"现在"}}],"scope_correction_refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":13,"revision":"1","sha256":"4dc86be3b15902bf92fb9ec57a094aaae3000b802aeb3f926d4fd30b128bc8d6","start":0}],"user_premise":null},"revision":"1","schema":"relationship-input.v1","stage":"S1","turn_id":"1"},"source_kind":"AI_synthetic_new_source_family_development"}],"schema":"mindthus.hard-route-cases-v1"}
